@startuml Binance System Deployment Architecture

title Hệ Thống Xử Lý Dữ Liệu Binance - Deployment Architecture

!define RECTANGLE_STYLE
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam arrowColor #333333

package "External Services" {
    cloud [Binance\nPublic API] as BinancePublic
}

package "Docker Containers" {
    package "Application Layer" {
        frame "binance-ingest Container" {
            component [NestJS App\nPort: 3000] as NestJSApp
            component [Kafka Consumer] as KafkaConsumer
        }
    }
    
    package "Infrastructure Layer" {
        frame "Kafka Broker" {
            database [Broker 1\nPort: 9092] as Kafka1
            note right of Kafka1 : Configurable:\nBROKERS=localhost:9092\nGROUP_ID=binance-consumer
        }
        
        frame "Elasticsearch Stack" {
            component [Elasticsearch\nPort: 9200] as ES1
            component [Kibana\nPort: 5601] as Kibana1
        }
        
        frame "Spark Cluster (Optional)" {
            component [Spark Master] as SparkMaster
            component [Spark Workers] as SparkWorkers
        }
    }
}

package "Environment Configuration" {
    note left
    .env Variables:
    ───────────────────
    PORT=3000
    KAFKA_BROKER=localhost:9092
    KAFKA_GROUP_ID=binance-consumer-group
    BINANCE_BTCUSDT_TICKER=wss://stream.binance.com/ws/btcusdt@ticker
    ELASTICSEARCH_HOST=localhost
    ELASTICSEARCH_PORT=9200
    end note
}

BinancePublic -right-> NestJSApp: WebSocket Connection\nPrice Stream
NestJSApp -down-> KafkaConsumer: Internal Routing
KafkaConsumer -down-> Kafka1: Publish/Subscribe\nTopic: crypto-prices
Kafka1 -down-> SparkMaster: Streaming Data Ingestion
SparkMaster -right-> SparkWorkers: Distributed Processing
SparkMaster -down-> ES1: Write Processed Data\nIndex: binance-ohlc
ES1 -down-> Kibana1: Data Source

note right of NestJSApp
Responsibilities:
• Connect to Binance WebSocket
• Parse streaming price data
• Emit events to Kafka
• Error handling & reconnection
end note

note right of Kafka1
Buffer & Reliability:
• Persist streaming data
• Enable fault tolerance
• Decouple producers/consumers
• Handle backpressure
end note

note right of SparkMaster
Real-time Processing:
• Window aggregation (1 min)
• OHLC calculation
• Statistics (avg, min, max)
• Micro-batch processing
end note

note right of ES1
Storage & Search:
• Time-series optimized
• Full-text search
• Index management
• Data persistence
end note

note right of Kibana1
Visualization:
• Candlestick charts
• Real-time dashboard
• Custom analytics
• User interface
end note

@enduml
